short_trace:
\[
\frac{2}{5} \div 3 = \frac{2}{5} \times \frac{1}{3}
\]
\[
\frac{2}{5} \times \frac{1}{3} = \frac{2\cdot 1}{5\cdot 3}
\]
\[
\frac{2\cdot 1}{5\cdot 3} = \frac{2}{15}
\]

Final answer: \frac{2}{15}

